SUMMARY:Gifts from the Heart: New Acquisitions at the Gorman
DESCRIPTION:With the expansion of the Gorman Museum of Native American Art at UC Davis into the new museum in 2023\, the additional space fostered new gifts from private collections across the country. This exhibition features artworks by more than 40 artists in a range of media including sculpture\, painting\, prints\, mixed media\, ceramics\, basketry and carving. \nMore info: https://arts.ucdavis.edu/events/gifts-heart-exhibition-subtitle-new-acquisitions-gorman
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/gifts-from-the-heart-new-acquisitions-at-the-gorman/
